#
# Whitelist context of Dockerfile.prebuilt (copied over the staged back/.dockerignore by scripts/deploy-full.sh when
# the back was compiled locally). Only what the image copies is streamed to the remote daemon: never src/, .libs/ or
# the resolved shared modules (tens of MB per deploy over the SSH tunnel). A BACK_BUILD_HOOK stages its extras under
# a top-level `_` name so they pass.
*
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!*.tgz
!*.crt
!dist
!_*
